      "content": "English: Pharisees | French: Pharisien | Latin: Pharisaeus | Origin: &#934;&#945;&#961;&#953;&#963;&#945;&#953;&#959;&#962; | Vietnamese: Pha-ri-sêu -- Mt 15,1.6 ; Cv 23,6.9",
